WEBVTT

01:26.500 --> 01:29.710
[Glory]

01:30.660 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 28]

01:33.009 --> 01:40.360
[Linji Prefectural Office]

01:47.039 --> 01:47.590
Didn't we agree

01:47.590 --> 01:49.000
that you'd hold nothing back from me?

01:49.000 --> 01:50.060
Lady Rong Shanbao,

01:50.200 --> 01:52.930
how many more things
are you still hiding from me?

02:00.590 --> 02:01.280
Shanbao,

02:02.150 --> 02:03.210
I'm really curious

02:03.710 --> 02:04.870
which one of us

02:05.590 --> 02:07.590
will end up going farther.

02:14.670 --> 02:16.329
Did you hear our conversation

02:17.120 --> 02:18.079
just now?

02:18.310 --> 02:19.710
She was forced into this.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.680
She has been looked down upon
since childhood.

02:21.680 --> 02:22.280
Now

02:23.000 --> 02:24.150
she just wants to secure her footing

02:24.150 --> 02:25.280
in the Rong Mansion.

02:30.560 --> 02:33.680
Mr. Bai, do you dare
to make a bet with me?

02:36.030 --> 02:37.190
If she's willing to give up the wealth

02:37.190 --> 02:38.650
of the Rong family for you,

02:38.870 --> 02:39.520
then it proves

02:39.520 --> 02:41.320
she's not completely ruthless,

02:41.360 --> 02:43.220
and I will let bygones be bygones.

02:43.310 --> 02:44.640
But if she abandons you,

02:45.240 --> 02:46.700
then you shall work for me.

02:47.150 --> 02:48.010
What do you say?

02:49.079 --> 02:50.430
We have a message from Lady Yunxi.

02:50.430 --> 02:52.150
It says that Jiang Yiqian has captured Li

02:52.150 --> 02:54.550
and is forcing Lady Yunxi
to do his bidding.

02:56.610 --> 02:57.360
Tell her

02:58.280 --> 02:59.950
to follow Jiang Yiqian's orders.

02:59.950 --> 03:00.580
Yes.

03:19.920 --> 03:21.250
Have you lost your mind?

03:21.680 --> 03:23.400
You even dared to burn the Tea King Tree?

03:23.400 --> 03:25.240
You can't make an omelet
without breaking a few eggs.

03:25.240 --> 03:26.840
Only in this way can we make Jiang Yiqian

03:26.840 --> 03:28.570
let down his guard completely.

03:29.360 --> 03:29.960
Fine.

03:30.560 --> 03:31.400
I've been running around,

03:31.400 --> 03:32.470
working tirelessly for you.

03:32.470 --> 03:33.680
But in the end, you won't even give me

03:33.680 --> 03:34.940
a single word of truth.

03:35.310 --> 03:37.310
Rong Shanbao, to you,

03:37.630 --> 03:39.000
am I just a tool to be summoned

03:39.000 --> 03:40.260
and dismissed at will?

03:40.910 --> 03:42.770
Jiang Yiqian is your sworn enemy.

03:43.190 --> 03:44.320
By eliminating him,

03:44.520 --> 03:45.980
wasn't I also helping you?

03:46.190 --> 03:48.320
What on earth are you even angry about?

03:49.470 --> 03:51.710
Fine, I'm being unreasonable.

03:52.440 --> 03:53.990
I shouldn't have worried
that you would get bullied by your sisters

03:53.990 --> 03:55.630
when you returned to the mansion.

03:55.630 --> 03:57.079
I shouldn't have worried
that Luo Deze would hold you accountable

03:57.079 --> 03:58.740
for the ruined birthday gift.

03:58.760 --> 04:00.870
And I certainly shouldn't have worried
that getting entangled in a murder case

04:00.870 --> 04:02.470
would ruin your reputation.

04:06.680 --> 04:07.740
Stop the carriage!

04:20.269 --> 04:22.240
My Lord, are you getting out?

04:26.320 --> 04:27.780
Are you still getting out?

04:30.530 --> 04:31.190
No, I'm not.

04:33.510 --> 04:34.770
When this case is over,

04:35.900 --> 04:37.630
I will give you an explanation.

04:42.240 --> 04:42.920
Good.

04:43.870 --> 04:44.470
I'll wait.

04:44.600 --> 04:46.330
Fragrant pouches and sachets!

05:03.090 --> 05:04.040
So you actually colluded with Rong Shanbao

05:04.040 --> 05:05.160
to deceive me!

05:06.920 --> 05:08.520
What a loyal servant indeed!

05:09.310 --> 05:11.560
Since you've chosen
to work for Rong Shanbao,

05:11.560 --> 05:13.310
why put on this mask of mercy?

05:14.120 --> 05:16.590
Yes, I deceived you.

05:17.600 --> 05:18.270
But Yunshu,

05:19.800 --> 05:20.680
you have

05:21.680 --> 05:22.630
gone astray.

05:24.070 --> 05:24.950
Astray?

05:28.310 --> 05:29.870
In this vast Rong Mansion,

05:30.680 --> 05:32.000
when Grandmother held Rong Shanbao up

05:32.000 --> 05:33.159
as the shining moon,

05:34.240 --> 05:35.159
did she ever stop to think

05:35.159 --> 05:38.090
there was still a weed clinging to life
in the corner?

05:38.670 --> 05:41.530
If I don't fight,
should I just wait for her charity?

05:42.390 --> 05:43.390
I must fight!

05:44.040 --> 05:45.190
I fight, whatever the cost!

05:45.190 --> 05:46.720
I fight, until the very end!

05:47.600 --> 05:49.530
I thought you would understand me.

05:50.280 --> 05:52.340
But why would even you stand in my way?

05:53.560 --> 05:54.750
Why would even you think

05:54.750 --> 05:56.030
I should admit guilt?

06:01.720 --> 06:04.190
Leave. I don't want to see you anymore.

06:11.470 --> 06:13.070
The day I fell into the river,

06:14.030 --> 06:15.670
the water, steeped in hatred,

06:15.670 --> 06:16.940
surged into my lungs.

06:18.270 --> 06:19.950
When I awoke, I swore

06:20.830 --> 06:22.430
that I myself would shackle

06:22.830 --> 06:25.270
the hands
that had pushed me into the river.

06:28.560 --> 06:30.040
Then you can do it now.

06:50.630 --> 06:52.830
Yet even now, I still cherish the memory

06:53.830 --> 06:55.490
of the quiet orchid fragrance

06:57.600 --> 06:59.720
on the sunny day we first met.

07:30.150 --> 07:33.010
I'm about to go to the capital
for the imperial exam.

07:33.170 --> 07:33.750
This will likely be

07:33.750 --> 07:35.480
the last time we see each other.

08:08.630 --> 08:11.040
Grandmother, it's time
to take your medicine.

08:11.040 --> 08:12.190
Set it down for now.

08:19.830 --> 08:21.360
What the hell are you doing?

08:22.100 --> 08:23.500
Let me tell you the truth.

08:24.070 --> 08:26.120
My eyes have been healed for a long time.

08:26.120 --> 08:27.600
All these years of biding my time

08:27.600 --> 08:29.800
were only to seek justice for my mother.

08:30.430 --> 08:32.669
Grandmother,
you must take your medicine obediently

08:32.669 --> 08:33.789
and stay alive

08:34.270 --> 08:35.440
to see with your own eyes

08:35.440 --> 08:36.630
that a maid's child

08:36.630 --> 08:38.080
will inherit the Rong family,

08:38.080 --> 08:40.140
and that my mother's memorial tablet

08:40.179 --> 08:41.320
will be rightfully

08:41.320 --> 08:43.650
placed in the Rong family ancestral hall.

08:44.000 --> 08:46.200
Drink! I'm telling you to drink!

09:02.980 --> 09:03.740
Mr. Yan.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.550
Why are you being so rude?

09:05.550 --> 09:06.410
Old Madam Rong,

09:06.420 --> 09:07.020
wake up!

09:07.280 --> 09:08.140
Old Madam Rong!

09:08.180 --> 09:10.510
-How dare you break into Chongxi Hall!
-Old Madam Rong!

09:10.510 --> 09:11.510
Someone come at once!

09:11.510 --> 09:13.110
Throw this insolent man out!

09:14.790 --> 09:16.390
Yes, someone should be called here

09:16.390 --> 09:18.440
to examine exactly
what is in this medicine!

09:18.440 --> 09:19.120
Mr. Yan,

09:19.720 --> 09:20.120
I show you respect

09:20.120 --> 09:21.840
because you're an honored guest
invited by Grandmother,

09:21.840 --> 09:23.200
but you have no right to spout nonsense

09:23.200 --> 09:24.320
and falsely accuse me!

09:24.320 --> 09:26.000
Please go back to pack your things now

09:26.000 --> 09:27.400
and leave the Rong Mansion immediately.

09:27.400 --> 09:28.130
Lady Yunshu,

09:29.140 --> 09:31.000
Mr. Bai has cherished you deeply.

09:31.390 --> 09:32.550
He once earnestly advised you

09:32.550 --> 09:33.880
to leave this den of intrigue.

09:33.880 --> 09:35.100
But you were filled with hatred,

09:35.100 --> 09:36.910
trapped in the mire
and refusing to free yourself.

09:36.910 --> 09:38.910
Even now, you still show no remorse.

09:38.910 --> 09:40.360
Do you truly not fear karmic retribution?

09:40.360 --> 09:41.560
How did you know that?

09:41.840 --> 09:44.120
This is a private matter
of our Rong family.

09:44.120 --> 09:44.750
An outsider

09:44.750 --> 09:46.480
like you has no right to butt in.

09:47.970 --> 09:49.730
Mr. Yan is indeed an outsider.

09:50.400 --> 09:52.060
As a member of the Rong family,

09:52.120 --> 09:53.520
I can intervene, can't I?

09:58.670 --> 09:59.470
Lady Shanbao,

10:00.290 --> 10:01.290
you've returned.

10:01.390 --> 10:02.510
Thank you, Mr. Yan.

10:03.140 --> 10:04.790
I'll take care of the Rong family's

10:04.790 --> 10:05.820
private matters.

10:12.080 --> 10:12.750
Yunshu.

10:13.210 --> 10:16.270
I've properly resolved the matter
of the birthday gift.

10:16.270 --> 10:17.670
Now that things have come to this,

10:17.670 --> 10:19.840
it is time to settle accounts with you
properly.

10:19.840 --> 10:21.370
Your most unforgivable act

10:22.010 --> 10:22.720
was confining

10:22.720 --> 10:24.630
our sick grandmother

10:25.000 --> 10:26.660
to control the entire family.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.480
This is the deepest filial impiety.

10:28.480 --> 10:29.390
What right do you have

10:29.390 --> 10:30.390
to lecture me?

10:30.960 --> 10:31.890
Let's not forget

10:32.080 --> 10:33.600
that now you're still just a granddaughter

10:33.600 --> 10:34.360
who has been expelled

10:34.360 --> 10:36.000
from the Rong Mansion by Grandmother.

10:36.000 --> 10:36.600
Guards.

10:36.960 --> 10:37.680
Guards!

10:40.200 --> 10:40.750
These two

10:40.750 --> 10:42.600
are disturbing Grandmother's rest.

10:42.600 --> 10:43.870
Throw both of them out!

10:46.790 --> 10:48.770
Have you forgotten what Grandmother said?

10:48.770 --> 10:49.700
While she's ill,

10:49.870 --> 10:52.360
I am in charge of all the affairs
of the Rong family.

10:52.360 --> 10:53.390
Are you all deaf?

10:54.150 --> 10:55.360
Throw them out now!

10:55.750 --> 10:57.630
Otherwise, when Grandmother wakes up,

10:57.630 --> 10:59.490
every one of you will be punished.

11:00.840 --> 11:01.630
Rong Yunshu.

11:03.400 --> 11:04.080
Yang Yitang

11:04.080 --> 11:05.540
has already turned you in.

11:05.670 --> 11:07.750
You conspired with him
to bring trouble into our family,

11:07.750 --> 11:09.350
which made Grandmother ill.

11:09.630 --> 11:10.910
Now, Jiang Yiqian, the man behind him,

11:10.910 --> 11:12.200
has also been arrested.

11:12.200 --> 11:14.200
If you are still so stubborn
and refuse to repent,

11:14.200 --> 11:16.030
I'll have the constables take you away

11:16.030 --> 11:17.690
and interrogate you in court.

11:18.960 --> 11:20.120
I'm stubborn?

11:20.750 --> 11:22.550
She was the one
who was stuck in outdated ways

11:22.550 --> 11:24.480
and brought untold harm to others.

11:24.670 --> 11:27.030
She was the one
who was obsessed with social standing

11:27.030 --> 11:28.630
and treated my birth mother as someone

11:28.630 --> 11:29.960
to be trampled on by all.

11:30.270 --> 11:31.030
She was

11:31.870 --> 11:32.750
the one who watched

11:32.750 --> 11:33.840
her own son

11:33.840 --> 11:34.910
die of grief,

11:35.200 --> 11:36.840
forbade him to be buried
in the family graveyard,

11:36.840 --> 11:39.630
and even barred me from paying homage
to my own parents.

11:39.630 --> 11:40.840
To outsiders,

11:41.080 --> 11:42.150
she is the respectable head

11:42.150 --> 11:43.210
of the Rong family,

11:43.390 --> 11:45.670
helping the distressed
and doing good far and wide.

11:45.670 --> 11:47.530
But to members of the Rong family,

11:47.550 --> 11:49.080
she's nothing but a tyrant!

11:49.240 --> 11:51.720
Rong Shanbao, you were only 13

11:52.700 --> 11:53.630
when she forced you

11:53.630 --> 11:55.240
to join the tea caravan
on its trade routes,

11:55.240 --> 11:57.440
nearly causing you to die far from home.

11:57.750 --> 11:59.750
No matter how much you sacrificed
for the Rong family,

11:59.750 --> 12:01.600
the moment you showed
the slightest disobedience,

12:01.600 --> 12:03.480
you became a traitor to the Rong family,

12:03.480 --> 12:04.510
stripped of everything

12:04.510 --> 12:05.150
and expelled from the Rong family.

12:05.150 --> 12:05.880
Is that fair?

12:06.750 --> 12:08.950
You all accuse me of wanting to harm her.

12:09.000 --> 12:10.720
But why would I need to lift a finger?

12:10.720 --> 12:12.630
The state she's in now

12:13.840 --> 12:15.840
is Heaven's punishment for her.

12:16.270 --> 12:17.150
Heaven is punishing

12:17.150 --> 12:18.740
this overbearing old tyrant,

12:18.740 --> 12:20.440
leaving her hands paralyzed,
her voice silenced,

12:20.440 --> 12:22.910
her kin estranged
and her possessions stripped away!

12:22.910 --> 12:24.750
Your father truly loved your mother.

12:24.750 --> 12:26.790
They were indeed a rare loving couple.

12:26.790 --> 12:28.360
But for his personal desires,

12:28.360 --> 12:30.720
your father abandoned
the entire tea caravan.

12:30.720 --> 12:32.550
The entire tea shipment
was looted by desert bandits.

12:32.550 --> 12:34.440
More than 10 people died
or were injured.

12:34.440 --> 12:36.270
If I had been the head of the Rong family,

12:36.270 --> 12:39.030
I would also have needed
to give the tea farmers an explanation.

12:39.030 --> 12:40.150
In her position,

12:40.600 --> 12:43.060
Grandmother faced many difficult choices.

12:44.360 --> 12:46.000
When I was lost in the desert,

12:46.440 --> 12:47.000
so thirsty that I nearly

12:47.000 --> 12:48.840
had to drink my own blood to save myself,

12:48.840 --> 12:49.970
I did blame her once.

12:50.660 --> 12:52.270
But had I been in her position,

12:52.270 --> 12:53.530
I, too, might have been

12:53.790 --> 12:55.390
forced to do certain things.

12:57.720 --> 12:58.720
Isn't that right,

12:59.630 --> 13:00.430
Grandmother?

13:13.820 --> 13:15.680
I'm not as magnanimous as you are.

13:20.240 --> 13:21.030
Now that I cannot

13:21.030 --> 13:22.830
seek justice for my poor mother,

13:23.440 --> 13:25.080
what joy is there in living?

13:25.790 --> 13:27.360
Better to just end it all.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.000
Mr. Yan.

14:12.970 --> 14:13.400
I...

14:14.510 --> 14:15.710
I didn't mean to do it.

14:15.960 --> 14:17.760
He threw himself onto the blade.

14:18.840 --> 14:20.500
Take Lady Yunshu away at once.

14:21.760 --> 14:22.490
Lady Yunshu.

14:26.090 --> 14:26.850
Mr. Yan!

14:33.730 --> 14:34.660
Lady Shanbao,

14:35.960 --> 14:38.960
thank goodness you're alright.

14:41.390 --> 14:42.150
Mr. Yan!

15:03.000 --> 15:04.000
Well, well,

15:04.000 --> 15:05.960
you work here
but secretly serve someone else.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.030
You've become a spy

15:07.030 --> 15:08.120
for Lady Shanbao, haven't you?

15:08.120 --> 15:08.750
Spare me, sir!

15:08.750 --> 15:09.670
I wouldn't dare!

15:09.670 --> 15:11.310
I would never dare to do such a thing!

15:11.310 --> 15:12.790
I ordered you to seal off the riverbank

15:12.790 --> 15:14.440
and spare no effort in the rescue.

15:14.440 --> 15:15.390
You told me you couldn't

15:15.390 --> 15:16.860
find any trace of Bai Yingsheng.

15:16.860 --> 15:18.360
Yet he conspired with Lady Rong Shanbao

15:18.360 --> 15:20.880
and snuck
into the Provincial Governor's Office.

15:20.880 --> 15:22.070
Jun Dai, oh Jun Dai.

15:22.550 --> 15:24.880
How remarkably well you kept this from me.

15:25.840 --> 15:26.840
Lady Shanbao said

15:27.200 --> 15:28.510
Mr. Bai was reserved for other purposes

15:28.510 --> 15:30.550
and couldn't be handed over
to the authorities.

15:30.550 --> 15:31.720
Please don't be angry, My Lord.

15:31.720 --> 15:33.520
I am completely loyal to you, My Lord.

15:33.520 --> 15:35.120
It's just that my parents and sister

15:35.120 --> 15:36.510
still work for the Rong family.

15:36.510 --> 15:37.510
Their fate

15:37.630 --> 15:39.720
rests entirely in the hands
of Lady Shanbao.

15:39.720 --> 15:41.120
But I dare swear to Heaven

15:41.320 --> 15:42.360
that apart from saving lives
for good karma,

15:42.360 --> 15:43.030
there is not a single thing

15:43.030 --> 15:44.760
I have hidden from you, My Lord.

15:44.960 --> 15:46.420
Do you dare swear to Heaven

15:46.640 --> 15:49.240
that you haven't hidden anything else
from me?

15:52.320 --> 15:53.480
My Lord, you've said before

15:53.480 --> 15:55.210
that my loyalty to Lady Shanbao

15:55.750 --> 15:56.960
is loyalty to you.

15:59.320 --> 16:00.200
It seems that Rong Shanbao

16:00.200 --> 16:01.770
is still keeping far too many things
from me.

16:01.770 --> 16:02.570
Take him away.

16:03.000 --> 16:06.000
Give him 10 lashes
before bringing him back for questioning.

16:06.000 --> 16:06.600
No, no!

16:06.600 --> 16:07.440
Please don't!

16:07.600 --> 16:08.860
My Lord, I'll tell you.

16:09.320 --> 16:10.780
I'll tell you everything!

16:10.910 --> 16:11.550
Speak.

16:12.030 --> 16:13.960
As long as it's about Rong Shanbao,

16:14.270 --> 16:16.270
you must not leave a single word out.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.270
Old Madam Rong's illness

16:21.440 --> 16:23.360
started from her ankles,

16:23.750 --> 16:25.790
gradually spreading upward to the knees.

16:25.790 --> 16:28.270
Within a month or two, it spread
to the thigh bones.

16:28.270 --> 16:30.530
Then it moved to the shoulders and elbows

16:30.850 --> 16:32.850
before finally reaching the hands.

16:33.360 --> 16:37.420
It started with numbness and itching.
Then it felt like insects gnawing,

16:38.000 --> 16:40.510
with the pain worsening through the night.

16:41.270 --> 16:44.720
Since the illness didn't develop
overnight,

16:46.080 --> 16:49.870
it cannot be cured in a month or two.

16:50.790 --> 16:52.360
Doctor, your words are indeed strange.

16:52.360 --> 16:54.200
Grandmother has always been
in good health.

16:54.200 --> 16:56.430
She had a stroke
because she was frightened by bandits.

16:56.430 --> 16:57.550
But according to your words,

16:57.550 --> 16:59.410
it sounds like a chronic illness.

17:00.030 --> 17:01.600
If Grandmother had truly been ill,

17:01.600 --> 17:03.800
how could she have shown no signs at all?

17:04.510 --> 17:06.310
Yunxi, did you know of this?

17:11.970 --> 17:13.369
So your prescription...

17:13.710 --> 17:16.160
The prescription from Dr. Sun earlier

17:16.510 --> 17:19.040
primarily targets
excessive internal heat.

17:19.640 --> 17:23.400
It is effective to some extent.

17:24.109 --> 17:27.030
But Old Madam Rong's illness

17:27.030 --> 17:29.110
is caused by chronic arthralgia.

17:29.790 --> 17:33.050
She ought to take
the Life-Prolonging Decoction instead,

17:33.110 --> 17:35.880
which will surely work
after just one dose.

17:36.370 --> 17:38.230
Can it really be that miraculous?

17:41.550 --> 17:42.810
Grandmother, you're awake!

17:42.810 --> 17:44.480
-Grandmother, are you alright?
-Old Madam Rong.

17:44.480 --> 17:45.280
You're awake.

17:45.510 --> 17:46.590
-Grandmother.
-Grandmother.

17:46.590 --> 17:47.720
How are you feeling?

17:53.840 --> 17:54.440
Hurry.

17:55.270 --> 17:56.030
The moment Grandmother woke up,

17:56.030 --> 17:57.310
she kept asking to see you.

17:57.310 --> 17:58.070
Hurry up.

17:59.360 --> 18:00.090
Don't panic.

18:01.990 --> 18:03.510
You stay at Xinfang Pavilion.

18:03.510 --> 18:04.640
If Mr. Yan wakes up,

18:04.920 --> 18:06.320
come report to me at once.

18:06.510 --> 18:07.040
Let's go.

18:20.870 --> 18:23.750
Grandmother, are you feeling better?

18:28.720 --> 18:30.030
You've suffered a lot.

18:33.070 --> 18:35.240
Grandmother, if you're no longer angry
with me,

18:35.240 --> 18:37.170
I don't feel it's suffering at all.

18:50.270 --> 18:51.070
Where is she?

18:52.820 --> 18:55.440
She is confined in the small courtyard
behind the ancestral hall.

18:55.440 --> 18:58.970
Once you've fully recovered,
you can deal with her personally.

19:00.680 --> 19:02.750
How is Bailou doing with his injuries?

19:02.750 --> 19:04.150
According to the doctor,

19:04.650 --> 19:06.380
Mr. Yan's injuries are severe,

19:06.480 --> 19:07.880
and his life is in danger.

19:08.160 --> 19:09.690
Whether he can pull through

19:09.720 --> 19:11.920
depends on how he fares
these next two days.

19:11.920 --> 19:12.830
I was thinking

19:13.640 --> 19:16.350
we should send someone
to inform the Yan family immediately,

19:16.350 --> 19:17.960
but I feared the journey would be too far

19:17.960 --> 19:18.960
to make it in time.

19:19.350 --> 19:21.010
Fortune favors the virtuous.

19:21.790 --> 19:22.990
He is a fine young man,

19:24.110 --> 19:26.240
even sacrificing himself to save you.

19:27.110 --> 19:28.960
When you weren't at the Rong Mansion,

19:28.960 --> 19:30.350
he still spoke well of you to me

19:30.350 --> 19:31.480
every single day.

19:31.960 --> 19:33.290
It was all because of him

19:34.350 --> 19:37.350
that you and I could finally reconcile.

19:39.270 --> 19:41.530
He is truly a blessing to our Rong family.

19:42.640 --> 19:44.770
There are people attending to me here.

19:45.110 --> 19:46.640
You need not stay by my side.

19:47.110 --> 19:48.370
Go to Xinfang Pavilion

19:48.920 --> 19:50.750
and make sure his life is saved.

19:52.200 --> 19:52.850
Okay.

19:53.510 --> 19:56.270
I'll go watch over him
at Xinfang Pavilion right away.

19:56.270 --> 19:58.030
Grandmother, your illness
has only just taken a turn for the better.

19:58.030 --> 19:59.790
You must not exhaust yourself
with worries.

19:59.790 --> 20:01.270
Let me help you lie down first.

20:01.270 --> 20:01.880
No.

20:03.680 --> 20:04.960
Go tell Bailou

20:06.620 --> 20:08.020
that if he pulls through,

20:09.070 --> 20:09.790
I'll

20:10.400 --> 20:12.400
grant him a wish.

20:14.030 --> 20:14.680
A wish?

20:15.420 --> 20:17.040
A wish that he has long kept hidden

20:17.040 --> 20:18.130
in his heart

20:18.510 --> 20:21.040
and has been too hesitant
to ever speak aloud.

20:22.490 --> 20:24.210
As long as he survives,

20:24.960 --> 20:26.720
I will make it come true for him.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.700
[Prison]

20:37.350 --> 20:38.960
I have urgent business
to discuss with Lord Luo.

20:38.960 --> 20:40.490
Go tell him I need to see him!

20:40.720 --> 20:41.920
Someone come at once!

20:41.960 --> 20:43.290
I demand to see Lord Luo!

20:44.400 --> 20:45.000
Lord Jiang,

20:45.000 --> 20:47.590
you're making such a fuss
to see the Imperial Inspector.

20:47.590 --> 20:49.590
What exactly do you need to report?

20:50.920 --> 20:52.310
Through the ages,

20:53.110 --> 20:55.310
the cycle of rise and fall never ends.

20:55.830 --> 20:56.550
Young man,

20:57.030 --> 20:58.590
never burn all your bridges.

20:58.590 --> 21:00.350
Do not celebrate your victory too soon.

21:00.350 --> 21:01.070
Lord Jiang,

21:02.070 --> 21:03.000
you yourself handed over

21:03.000 --> 21:04.350
Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku.

21:05.070 --> 21:06.470
For a single set of books,

21:06.720 --> 21:08.400
you persisted in targeting Madam Yang
even after she had left

21:08.400 --> 21:09.260
the Wei family.

21:09.850 --> 21:11.580
Now the witness has confessed.

21:11.920 --> 21:13.420
What excuses do you have left?

21:13.420 --> 21:14.180
Shut up!

21:14.590 --> 21:15.720
I did nothing wrong!

21:15.830 --> 21:17.590
Wei Kejian was the real murderer!

21:17.590 --> 21:19.110
The verdict
was not a miscarriage of justice!

21:19.110 --> 21:20.270
Madam Yang was nothing but a prostitute

21:20.270 --> 21:21.310
the Weis hired!

21:21.510 --> 21:23.510
You and Rong Shanbao

21:24.240 --> 21:25.640
are conspiring together

21:25.640 --> 21:26.640
to frame me!

21:27.030 --> 21:28.350
I want to see the Emperor!

21:28.350 --> 21:29.320
I want to appeal for justice!

21:29.320 --> 21:30.720
I want to see the Emperor!

21:30.960 --> 21:33.090
My Lord, Miss Xu requests an audience.

21:34.270 --> 21:35.400
Miss Xu?

21:37.270 --> 21:38.160
Xu Meiying?

21:40.590 --> 21:43.390
Lu Jianglai,
you are far from blameless yourself.

21:43.400 --> 21:45.030
To serve your own selfish ends,

21:45.030 --> 21:45.880
you pinned Madam Yang's death

21:45.880 --> 21:46.830
on me!

21:47.110 --> 21:48.590
You and those despicable people

21:48.590 --> 21:49.880
are birds of a feather!

21:54.480 --> 21:56.200
Lu Jianglai!

21:56.910 --> 21:59.490
Guards! Let me out!

22:14.960 --> 22:16.980
On his way back to the capital,
Minister Xu

22:16.980 --> 22:19.350
was seized by a sudden recurrence
of his old ailment and lost consciousness.

22:19.350 --> 22:21.270
The boat made an emergency stop
at Songzhou,

22:21.270 --> 22:23.510
but before a doctor
could be summoned to treat him,

22:23.510 --> 22:26.440
Minister Xu had passed away,

22:27.030 --> 22:28.510
his pulses ceasing entirely.

22:28.510 --> 22:30.720
Miss Xu is escorting his coffin
back to his hometown.

22:30.720 --> 22:32.780
She is here to inform you of his death.

23:06.440 --> 23:08.900
When you retire
and return to your hometown,

23:09.200 --> 23:11.110
your boat will still pass through Linji.

23:11.110 --> 23:11.840
At that time,

23:12.110 --> 23:13.980
I will bring the finest Longjing tea

23:13.980 --> 23:15.910
and wait for you at the dock.

23:22.740 --> 23:25.830
Senior Lu, the Xu family
is not a big family,

23:26.070 --> 23:28.000
and I am my father's only daughter.

23:28.310 --> 23:31.240
If I go back alone,
I might be bullied by my relatives.

23:32.440 --> 23:33.900
On his deathbed, my father

23:33.960 --> 23:35.560
told me to seek help from you.

23:36.520 --> 23:37.550
Senior Lu, I beg you,

23:37.550 --> 23:40.680
for the sake of the old bonds
between my father and you...

23:42.780 --> 23:43.640
Please, don't!

23:44.270 --> 23:45.200
Please sit down.

23:51.960 --> 23:52.960
I'll never forget

23:53.390 --> 23:55.650
the kindness
your father bestowed on me.

23:55.880 --> 23:58.480
I will ensure
his funeral is handled properly.

24:00.030 --> 24:00.720
Have several quiet rooms

24:00.720 --> 24:01.720
prepared at once.

24:02.400 --> 24:04.070
And make sure
the Xu family is well settled.

24:04.070 --> 24:04.680
Yes.

24:06.000 --> 24:06.600
Junior Xu.

24:07.110 --> 24:09.160
You must not let grief ravage your health.

24:09.160 --> 24:11.270
Your own well-being must still come first.

24:11.270 --> 24:12.930
I see that you don't look well.

24:13.350 --> 24:15.030
Go and rest in the rear quarters first.

24:15.030 --> 24:17.360
All other matters can be discussed later.

24:18.200 --> 24:18.830
Jun Dai.

24:21.240 --> 24:22.960
Miss Xu, please.

24:24.830 --> 24:26.030
Senior Lu, forgive me

24:26.960 --> 24:28.750
for losing control of my emotions.

24:28.750 --> 24:30.810
I didn't bring many servants with me.

24:31.400 --> 24:33.330
Three or four rooms will be enough.

24:33.550 --> 24:34.310
But on my way here,

24:34.310 --> 24:36.710
I came across a beggar
on the brink of death.

24:37.190 --> 24:38.650
I felt compassion for him,

24:39.030 --> 24:40.350
so I brought him along.

24:41.000 --> 24:43.260
I'm sorry for causing you undue trouble.

24:43.640 --> 24:44.640
He is gravely ill.

24:45.200 --> 24:46.110
Senior Lu, please

24:46.110 --> 24:47.400
find a doctor for him.

25:03.380 --> 25:04.480
What kind

25:04.480 --> 25:05.280
of deep hatred

25:06.110 --> 25:07.510
could drive someone to do

25:07.680 --> 25:09.410
something so cruel to another?

25:09.480 --> 25:10.740
His limbs were ruined,

25:11.640 --> 25:13.680
his voice silenced, his sight lost.

25:14.750 --> 25:15.680
Yet he desperately tried

25:15.680 --> 25:17.410
to crawl all the way into Linji.

25:17.600 --> 25:19.640
He was being teased
by a group of children.

25:19.640 --> 25:20.640
I took pity on him,

25:21.550 --> 25:22.880
so I brought him with me.

25:24.310 --> 25:25.440
Get a doctor for him.

25:26.070 --> 25:26.590
Yes.

26:14.440 --> 26:15.500
Why don't you go in?

26:15.970 --> 26:18.690
She said, "I thought
you would understand me.

26:19.470 --> 26:21.440
But why would even you stand in my way?

26:21.440 --> 26:22.790
Why would even you think

26:22.940 --> 26:24.200
I should admit guilt?"

26:25.440 --> 26:26.240
Lady Shanbao.

26:28.310 --> 26:29.310
Was I wrong?

26:31.830 --> 26:32.640
You two are

26:33.600 --> 26:34.670
quite a pair.

26:38.610 --> 26:41.240
There's something I need to tell you.

27:03.640 --> 27:05.000
Grandmother hasn't fully recovered yet.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.480
How could you bring her here
while she's still so weak?

27:06.480 --> 27:08.830
-You...
-It was I who insisted they carry me here.

27:08.830 --> 27:09.830
Don't blame them.

27:11.640 --> 27:12.880
Grandmother, please go back.

27:12.880 --> 27:14.740
I'll stay here and watch over him.

27:17.380 --> 27:18.620
Do you think

27:19.240 --> 27:21.240
I'm overly concerned about Bailou?

27:25.680 --> 27:26.590
You know

27:27.400 --> 27:28.790
that the Yan family once sent a man

27:28.790 --> 27:29.920
to our Rong Mansion.

27:31.300 --> 27:34.610
He was Bailou's grand-uncle.

27:35.350 --> 27:36.960
He was the ninth son of the Yan family,

27:36.960 --> 27:39.360
so everyone called him Ninth Young Master.

27:39.430 --> 27:41.330
Though he was handsome,

27:42.310 --> 27:45.400
he was too gentle and too reserved.

27:46.790 --> 27:48.680
He was truly not much to my liking.

27:49.500 --> 27:51.350
I seldom visited his quarters.

27:51.910 --> 27:53.270
But in the end,

27:56.350 --> 27:57.590
he gave his own life

27:58.750 --> 27:59.830
to save mine.

28:03.000 --> 28:04.060
I didn't know this.

28:04.670 --> 28:07.330
Grandmother,
you never mentioned this before.

28:08.400 --> 28:10.400
It was a long time ago.

28:12.300 --> 28:15.870
That year, he accompanied me
on the tea caravan route.

28:17.750 --> 28:19.750
When I got trapped in the quicksand,

28:20.400 --> 28:22.400
I thought that was the end of my life.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.370
I never imagined

28:25.480 --> 28:27.740
that he would risk his own life
to save me.

28:29.030 --> 28:30.510
When I saw Bailou that day,

28:31.880 --> 28:33.610
I felt somewhat disappointed,

28:34.160 --> 28:36.760
because the two of them
didn't look much alike.

28:37.920 --> 28:39.450
It wasn't until I saw Bailou

28:39.510 --> 28:41.720
step forward to shield you from the blade

28:41.720 --> 28:43.250
that I suddenly understood

28:43.640 --> 28:45.170
the two of them were the same

28:45.240 --> 28:46.720
in at least one aspect.

28:47.440 --> 28:48.770
The men of the Yan family

28:49.410 --> 28:51.410
are ready to lay down their lives

28:51.790 --> 28:53.120
for the women they love.

28:58.440 --> 28:59.770
Fortunately, there are

28:59.790 --> 29:02.060
two renowned doctors, Dr. Hou and Dr. Sun,
in our mansion.

29:02.060 --> 29:02.900
Dr. Sun

29:03.150 --> 29:05.240
is especially skilled at treating wounds.

29:05.240 --> 29:06.240
He will surely spare no effort

29:06.240 --> 29:07.500
to save Mr. Yan's life.

29:08.200 --> 29:10.000
Please don't be too distressed.

29:11.830 --> 29:14.510
The Rong and Yan families have been bound
by marriage for generations,

29:14.510 --> 29:16.680
maintaining a long-standing alliance.

29:16.680 --> 29:17.960
Now, the Yan family is thriving

29:17.960 --> 29:19.000
in the Shu region.

29:19.480 --> 29:20.310
Last year,

29:20.640 --> 29:22.480
they shipped 20,000 bales of tea

29:22.480 --> 29:24.310
via the Guanmaosong Ancient Road.

29:24.310 --> 29:25.310
They sent their son

29:25.310 --> 29:26.440
to our Rong family.

29:27.000 --> 29:30.130
Their intention to strengthen the alliance
is obvious.

29:31.160 --> 29:32.750
I also intend to open up

29:33.070 --> 29:35.000
a new tea trade route for our family.

29:35.000 --> 29:35.720
As long as Bailou

29:35.720 --> 29:37.390
pulls through,

29:37.920 --> 29:39.240
you two shall marry.

29:44.350 --> 29:45.350
My mind is made up.

29:45.910 --> 29:48.550
Fushan Temple is really well-known
for making wishes come true.

29:48.550 --> 29:49.150
Tomorrow,

29:50.460 --> 29:52.390
go draw a fortune stick for Bailou.

30:00.470 --> 30:01.230
Yes.

30:02.850 --> 30:05.870
[Fushan Temple]

30:15.590 --> 30:16.220
Slow down.

30:19.300 --> 30:22.160
In his later years, my father devoted
himself to Buddhist practice,

30:22.160 --> 30:24.620
often visiting temples
to listen to sutras.

30:24.680 --> 30:27.070
Fushan Temple is the most eminent
monastery in Jiangnan,

30:27.070 --> 30:29.330
holding scripture lectures each month.

30:29.720 --> 30:30.720
I intend to place

30:30.860 --> 30:32.690
a memorial tablet here in his honor,

30:32.690 --> 30:34.420
fulfilling his lifelong wish.

30:34.830 --> 30:36.350
However, the abbot, Master Xuhui,

30:36.350 --> 30:37.710
is a revered monk of our time.

30:37.710 --> 30:39.110
It's not easy to meet him.

30:39.710 --> 30:41.400
So I have to trouble you to take time out

30:41.400 --> 30:42.830
of your busy schedule to accompany me.

30:42.830 --> 30:45.230
There is no need for such formality
between us.

30:45.230 --> 30:48.490
The kindness Minister Xu bestowed on me
was immeasurable.

30:48.490 --> 30:51.770
Even if I were to sacrifice myself,
I couldn't repay a fraction of it.

30:51.770 --> 30:54.700
Being able to do something for him now
is a privilege.

30:55.550 --> 30:57.150
I don't deserve such thanks.

31:00.920 --> 31:01.640
This is what Grandmother

31:01.640 --> 31:02.640
wanted me to see?

31:03.310 --> 31:04.110
Lady Shanbao.

31:04.200 --> 31:05.000
That Miss Xu

31:05.000 --> 31:06.350
was Minister Xu's beloved daughter.

31:06.350 --> 31:07.350
After Minister Xu passed away,

31:07.350 --> 31:09.160
she came to seek refuge with Lord Lu.

31:09.160 --> 31:12.000
She was settled in the rear quarters
of the Government Office.

31:12.000 --> 31:13.960
These days,
word has spread all over the city.

31:12.030 --> 31:16.540
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

31:14.550 --> 31:15.310
They say...

31:16.240 --> 31:16.920
Say what?

31:16.570 --> 31:20.960
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

31:17.110 --> 31:19.110
They say that Lord Lu
is such a brilliant young man

31:19.110 --> 31:20.240
with an excellent reputation
as an official

31:20.240 --> 31:22.200
that countless noble families in town
have been

31:21.220 --> 31:23.640
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

31:22.200 --> 31:23.720
eager to marry their daughters to him.

31:23.670 --> 31:26.310
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

31:24.270 --> 31:26.110
Yet Lord Lu has remained unmoved,

31:26.110 --> 31:27.030
turning every single one of them down
politely.

31:26.520 --> 31:29.100
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

31:27.720 --> 31:28.680
Now it seems

31:28.920 --> 31:30.400
that he has been waiting for this Miss Xu.

31:29.120 --> 31:33.380
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

31:30.590 --> 31:32.160
Everyone says Miss Xu

31:32.160 --> 31:33.400
is Lord Lu's fiancée,

31:33.400 --> 31:37.970
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

31:34.200 --> 31:36.130
and that they will be married soon.

31:38.720 --> 31:41.930
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

31:38.880 --> 31:40.340
Grandmother is still ill,

31:40.830 --> 31:42.000
yet she goes to such trouble.

31:41.950 --> 31:45.770
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

31:43.310 --> 31:43.920
Let's go.

31:46.220 --> 31:49.770
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

31:58.310 --> 31:59.200
Senior Lu.

32:01.970 --> 32:04.460
[Rong Mansion]

32:02.740 --> 32:04.540
That oath-breaking scoundrel!

32:04.720 --> 32:06.250
You not only saved his life,

32:06.440 --> 32:07.920
but also defied Grandmother

32:07.920 --> 32:10.270
and gave up
the Rong family's vast fortune for him.

32:10.270 --> 32:11.830
If he had even a shred of conscience,

32:11.830 --> 32:12.920
he ought to lay down his life

32:12.920 --> 32:14.160
to repay your kindness.

32:14.160 --> 32:16.160
Yet he openly walked arm in arm
with another woman,

32:16.160 --> 32:18.560
clearly having an affair behind your back.

32:19.720 --> 32:21.750
He's unfaithful and shameless!

32:22.510 --> 32:23.710
Why did you come back?

32:23.800 --> 32:25.510
You should tear off his hypocritical mask

32:25.510 --> 32:27.770
and give him the punishment he deserves!

32:29.480 --> 32:31.190
What nonsense are you speaking?

32:31.190 --> 32:33.110
Lord Lu has been appointed
as Prefect of Linji.

32:33.110 --> 32:34.400
He has even brought down Jiang Yiqian

32:34.400 --> 32:36.090
who has always been domineering.

32:36.090 --> 32:37.990
He clearly has the Emperor's favor

32:37.990 --> 32:39.320
and a brilliant future.

32:39.760 --> 32:41.710
As long as he treats tea farmers well

32:41.710 --> 32:43.240
and respects the tea trade,

32:43.360 --> 32:45.510
our Rong family should not only
avoid offending him

32:45.510 --> 32:47.910
but also maintain good relations with him.

32:48.790 --> 32:50.190
What kind of talk is this?

32:50.750 --> 32:52.880
Do you really intend to cast him aside?

32:53.110 --> 32:53.720
Fine!

32:54.110 --> 32:55.880
Then let him pursue his political career.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.480
You focus on being the Tea King.

32:57.480 --> 32:59.200
A disloyal man like him

32:59.200 --> 33:00.790
is not worthy of being your husband.

33:00.790 --> 33:02.190
A clean break is the best.

33:02.580 --> 33:04.000
It prevents future trouble

33:04.000 --> 33:06.260
that would bring disgrace to our family.

33:07.960 --> 33:10.360
Lady Shanbao, my young master
has woken up.

33:24.070 --> 33:26.270
I've made you worry about me,
Old Madam Rong.

33:26.270 --> 33:27.750
How can I possibly be at ease?

33:27.750 --> 33:29.150
Do not stand on ceremony.

33:29.270 --> 33:32.100
From now on, don't call me Old Madam Rong.

33:34.440 --> 33:37.350
Just call me Grandmother.

33:55.030 --> 33:56.400
Since I came to Linji,

33:57.680 --> 34:00.640
Old Madam Rong, you have shown me
such care and kindness,

34:00.640 --> 34:02.470
which makes it only right

34:05.380 --> 34:06.780
to call you Grandmother.

34:08.889 --> 34:09.690
Young Master.

34:10.230 --> 34:12.429
Young Master, please stop talking now.

34:12.960 --> 34:13.820
It is all right.

34:14.840 --> 34:16.150
I'm not that delicate.

34:17.320 --> 34:19.150
It's merely a superficial wound.

34:19.150 --> 34:20.590
I'll recover soon.

34:21.389 --> 34:22.060
Bailou.

34:23.070 --> 34:25.630
You've been with our Rong family
for so long now.

34:25.630 --> 34:26.800
I have watched

34:27.110 --> 34:29.030
your every word and action closely.

34:29.030 --> 34:30.320
You are gentle and refined,

34:30.320 --> 34:32.030
and your conduct
is always measured and proper.

34:32.030 --> 34:34.630
Though many young men
came to the Rong Mansion,

34:34.630 --> 34:35.960
but only you

34:36.070 --> 34:37.870
have remained free from strife,

34:38.199 --> 34:39.730
open-hearted and upright,

34:40.510 --> 34:42.639
without a trace of resentment or envy.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.000
You truly have

34:44.000 --> 34:45.760
a remarkable character.

34:46.320 --> 34:48.670
I have been testing you
for quite some time.

34:48.670 --> 34:51.880
Only you can shoulder
such great responsibility

34:53.280 --> 34:54.550
and are worthy
of marrying our Rong family's

34:54.550 --> 34:55.840
future head.

34:58.630 --> 34:59.320
Bao.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.070
Shanbao.

35:05.510 --> 35:06.360
Don't forget

35:07.360 --> 35:08.920
what you've promised me.

35:19.800 --> 35:22.360
Mr. Yan, Grandmother is right.

35:23.030 --> 35:24.360
You need to recover soon

35:24.800 --> 35:27.660
so that our Rong family can prepare
for the wedding.

35:50.110 --> 35:51.030
The case about Jiang Yiqian

35:51.030 --> 35:52.550
has been sent to the Ministry of Justice.

35:52.550 --> 35:54.030
With Imperial Inspector Luo's testimony,

35:54.030 --> 35:55.690
the charges are irrefutable.

35:56.760 --> 35:58.550
Those wrongfully imprisoned magistrates

35:58.550 --> 35:59.810
will be released soon.

36:00.320 --> 36:02.150
Everyone praises your righteous courage

36:02.150 --> 36:03.350
and decisive action.

36:03.590 --> 36:04.760
You should be happy.

36:05.480 --> 36:07.410
Why do you wear such a worried look?

36:07.960 --> 36:09.220
There's still one case

36:09.710 --> 36:11.040
that remains unsolved.

36:12.070 --> 36:14.480
Yang Yitang has been interrogated
repeatedly.

36:14.480 --> 36:16.590
If he did not commit the murder
out of hatred,

36:16.590 --> 36:17.990
then who drove Madam Yang

36:19.150 --> 36:20.440
to her death?

36:21.010 --> 36:21.640
I thought

36:21.660 --> 36:23.460
you were troubled due to Miss Xu.

36:24.350 --> 36:25.680
Haven't you noticed it?

36:29.920 --> 36:30.760
Noticed what?

36:31.480 --> 36:32.280
Have some tea.

36:39.150 --> 36:41.190
Though the Xu family is small,

36:41.400 --> 36:42.840
Minister Xu was an upright official

36:42.840 --> 36:44.110
and deeply revered by local people.

36:44.110 --> 36:45.370
When Miss Xu goes back,

36:45.440 --> 36:47.380
there surely will be people
she can rely on.

36:47.380 --> 36:48.040
Minister Xu

36:48.050 --> 36:49.550
asked his beloved daughter to come to you.

36:49.550 --> 36:51.960
He clearly intended
to betroth his daughter to you.

36:51.960 --> 36:54.110
Miss Xu is beautiful and intelligent,

36:54.110 --> 36:55.480
skilled in both calligraphy and painting.

36:55.480 --> 36:57.510
Though from a noble family, she's humble,

36:57.510 --> 36:58.510
gentle and well-mannered.

36:58.510 --> 36:59.670
Such a fine woman

36:59.790 --> 37:01.450
is the dream of countless men.

37:01.590 --> 37:02.650
If she marries you,

37:02.760 --> 37:04.070
she'll surely be a virtuous wife

37:04.070 --> 37:05.800
and understanding companion.

37:08.960 --> 37:10.800
Someone just loves
to make things difficult for themselves.

37:10.800 --> 37:12.190
Fine, I'll say no more.

37:12.550 --> 37:13.880
Since you don't want to marry her,

37:13.880 --> 37:15.440
you must make yourself perfectly clear.

37:15.440 --> 37:17.010
Don't leave any room for misunderstanding.

37:17.010 --> 37:17.740
I know.

37:21.400 --> 37:23.530
My Lord, Miss Xu requests an audience.

37:24.800 --> 37:26.660
Minister Xu has just passed away.

37:27.230 --> 37:29.160
She is still in the depths of grief.

37:29.270 --> 37:30.450
If you're going to refuse the marriage,

37:30.450 --> 37:31.850
you must do it tactfully.

37:32.070 --> 37:34.730
Don't put the young lady
in an awkward position.

37:36.840 --> 37:37.900
Tell her to come in.

37:38.190 --> 37:38.760
Yes.

37:47.480 --> 37:49.440
Senior Lu, Mr. Lang.

37:52.230 --> 37:54.550
Here's some fresh tea. Take your time.

37:54.550 --> 37:55.150
I'll take my leave now.

37:55.150 --> 37:56.440
No, you stay.

37:57.190 --> 37:59.190
I'd like you to be here while we talk.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.670
Junior Xu,
you've come at the perfect time.

38:05.670 --> 38:07.040
I was just about to look for you.

38:07.040 --> 38:07.700
Have a seat.

38:14.670 --> 38:17.190
In the rear quarters,
the clerks, the constables

38:17.190 --> 38:18.790
and the visitors are all men.

38:19.390 --> 38:21.230
Aside from the old cook in the kitchen,

38:21.230 --> 38:22.630
there is not a single woman here.

38:22.630 --> 38:23.230
Junior Xu,

38:23.440 --> 38:25.240
you are an unmarried young lady.

38:25.550 --> 38:27.190
Staying here would be highly improper

38:27.190 --> 38:28.810
and would inevitably harm your reputation.

38:28.810 --> 38:30.670
Minister Xu asked me to take care of you.

38:30.670 --> 38:32.840
Then I am like your own brother.

38:33.230 --> 38:34.310
If I fail to do my utmost,

38:34.310 --> 38:35.840
that will be unforgivable.

38:36.760 --> 38:38.440
If you are unwilling
to return to your hometown,

38:38.440 --> 38:39.970
then I will find you another

38:40.020 --> 38:41.540
peaceful residence in Linji.

38:41.540 --> 38:43.340
You can move there in three days.

38:43.710 --> 38:45.480
Once your mourning period is over,

38:45.480 --> 38:46.710
I will find you

38:47.000 --> 38:48.330
a virtuous and talented

38:48.440 --> 38:50.480
husband from a family of equal standing.

38:50.480 --> 38:53.010
Only thus
can I live up to Minister Xu's trust.

38:54.590 --> 38:55.630
Senior Lu, I get

38:57.320 --> 38:58.450
what you're saying.

39:00.230 --> 39:01.480
Please continue your conversation.

39:01.480 --> 39:02.740
I'll take my leave now.

39:03.070 --> 39:03.760
Wait.

39:06.920 --> 39:08.800
Senior Lu asked you to stay here.

39:09.450 --> 39:11.710
It's to stop any gossip before it starts.

39:11.780 --> 39:13.840
He doesn't regard you as an outsider,

39:14.170 --> 39:16.370
so you don't have to be so eager to leave.

39:23.640 --> 39:24.640
My father is gone.

39:25.400 --> 39:27.180
And there is no elder in the family
to make decisions for me.

39:27.180 --> 39:28.780
So there are certain matters

39:29.240 --> 39:30.840
that I can decide for myself.

39:31.860 --> 39:32.710
Senior Lu, since you're willing

39:32.710 --> 39:34.320
to speak frankly with me,

39:34.970 --> 39:36.700
then I will also speak plainly.

39:37.440 --> 39:40.320
Some of my words may offend you.

39:43.050 --> 39:44.570
Do you refuse to marry me

39:46.300 --> 39:47.490
because you intend
to become a live-in son-in-law

39:47.490 --> 39:48.600
of the Rong family?

39:55.030 --> 39:57.440
You're really well-informed.

39:58.400 --> 39:59.110
I've heard the talk

39:59.110 --> 40:00.570
going around the streets.

40:01.230 --> 40:03.560
When my father was alive,
he used to tell me

40:03.960 --> 40:05.840
that all talented men

40:06.670 --> 40:08.640
are inevitably arrogant

40:09.110 --> 40:10.190
and unsociable.

40:10.920 --> 40:12.280
Such people can hardly

40:12.280 --> 40:13.940
succeed in official circles.

40:14.280 --> 40:15.630
He had many students.

40:16.710 --> 40:17.920
But only you, Senior Lu,

40:17.920 --> 40:19.250
were most valued by him,

40:20.370 --> 40:22.710
because you have
unwavering determination

40:22.710 --> 40:23.840
and great ambition,

40:24.570 --> 40:27.400
take on responsibility without flinching
in crisis,

40:27.400 --> 40:29.860
know when to be principled
and when to adapt,

40:30.360 --> 40:32.420
and hold a heart of true benevolence.

40:32.440 --> 40:33.440
Given time,

40:33.880 --> 40:35.110
you will surely assist the Emperor

40:35.110 --> 40:36.790
in achieving national rejuvenation

40:36.790 --> 40:38.650
and ushering in a prosperous era.

40:39.520 --> 40:40.580
Among all the promising talents at court,

40:40.580 --> 40:42.260
you were the only one

40:43.280 --> 40:44.880
my father spoke so highly of.

40:47.280 --> 40:49.340
But sometimes my father also worried

40:49.920 --> 40:51.320
that your early success

40:51.550 --> 40:53.480
would arouse envy and resentment.

40:53.560 --> 40:55.120
The slightest misstep

40:56.180 --> 40:57.780
could put your life in peril.

40:58.970 --> 41:00.900
What exactly are you trying to say?

41:01.110 --> 41:03.370
The Rong family
is a powerful local clan,

41:03.800 --> 41:05.530
with overwhelming influence.

41:05.880 --> 41:08.070
For others, marrying into the Rong family
as a son-in-law

41:08.070 --> 41:10.790
would surely be a shortcut
to instant prosperity.

41:10.790 --> 41:12.660
But if you marry Miss Rong,

41:13.280 --> 41:14.440
people will inevitably criticize

41:14.440 --> 41:17.400
that you let your personal feelings
cloud your judgment in the Wei case.

41:17.400 --> 41:18.460
More importantly,

41:18.880 --> 41:20.630
the Emperor trusts you so much.

41:21.450 --> 41:23.580
Sooner or later, you will leave Linji.

41:24.070 --> 41:25.730
For the sake of a single woman,

41:25.800 --> 41:28.320
would you truly be willing
to confine yourself to this tiny corner

41:28.320 --> 41:30.150
and abandon the grand aspirations
you vowed to pursue

41:30.150 --> 41:32.210
when you first entered officialdom?

41:34.550 --> 41:36.400
Miss Xu, you...

41:38.760 --> 41:41.000
Mr. Lang, Senior Lu,
please don't misunderstand me.

41:41.000 --> 41:42.150
It is true that my father intended

41:42.150 --> 41:44.010
to entrust my future to Senior Lu.

41:44.140 --> 41:45.170
But a marriage between a man and a woman

41:45.170 --> 41:47.230
must be blessed by the will of Heaven.

41:47.840 --> 41:49.500
If it's not my destined match,

41:49.760 --> 41:51.290
I have no desire to force it.

41:52.320 --> 41:53.980
Senior Lu, I said these words,

41:54.280 --> 41:55.190
only because I don't want to see

41:55.190 --> 41:57.850
you fail to fulfill your ambitions
in the future

41:59.230 --> 42:01.360
and regret it for the rest of your life.

42:02.960 --> 42:04.960
Junior Xu, I have already...

42:04.960 --> 42:06.920
Senior Lu, you should
think it through yourself

42:06.920 --> 42:08.450
and make your own decision.

42:10.880 --> 42:12.070
However, I came today

42:12.070 --> 42:13.600
for another urgent matter.

42:14.150 --> 42:15.230
It's about the beggar

42:15.230 --> 42:16.160
who came with me.

42:16.360 --> 42:17.710
What's wrong with that beggar?

42:17.710 --> 42:19.370
Please follow me, both of you.

42:24.510 --> 42:26.510
-Young Master!
-Young Master!

42:28.630 --> 42:30.400
-Young Master!
-Young Master!

42:30.440 --> 42:31.110
What's wrong?

42:31.110 --> 42:32.360
Young Master, what's wrong?

42:32.360 --> 42:34.280
-Please get up, Young Master!
-Young Master!

42:34.280 --> 42:35.080
Young Master!

42:35.550 --> 42:36.110
My Lord.

42:36.390 --> 42:37.520
Help him up quickly.

42:37.640 --> 42:38.200
Yes.

42:39.000 --> 42:40.260
Come on, Young Master.

42:44.570 --> 42:45.370
Young Master.

42:46.840 --> 42:49.190
I can see
that you originally had a handsome face

42:49.190 --> 42:50.250
and noble bearing.

42:50.510 --> 42:52.710
You don't seem like an ordinary beggar.

42:53.630 --> 42:55.560
I am Lu Jianglai, the Prefect of Linji.

42:55.560 --> 42:56.920
If you have suffered an injustice,

42:56.920 --> 42:58.450
you can tell me everything.

43:04.230 --> 43:05.230
There's no hurry.

43:06.070 --> 43:06.870
Can you write?

43:08.230 --> 43:09.010
Bring paper and brush.

43:09.010 --> 43:09.570
Yes.

43:26.670 --> 43:28.550
But his tendons in both hands and feet
have been severed.

43:28.550 --> 43:30.010
How can he possibly write?

43:34.070 --> 43:36.070
He can hold the brush with his mouth.

43:36.350 --> 43:37.950
We must at least give it a try.

43:38.290 --> 43:39.290
That makes sense.

43:54.050 --> 43:55.260
What is he writing?

43:55.320 --> 43:56.920
It's completely illegible.

43:58.690 --> 43:59.550
Take your time.

43:59.880 --> 44:00.630
Don't rush.

44:08.460 --> 44:09.060
Stay calm.

44:09.320 --> 44:10.870
I know you have grievances to express.

44:10.870 --> 44:12.630
However, even 3 years may not be enough
for a child to learn to write well.

44:12.630 --> 44:13.960
You're using your mouth
instead of your hands.

44:13.960 --> 44:15.360
That must be much harder.

44:17.230 --> 44:18.090
Take your time.

44:18.140 --> 44:19.440
You can practice it slowly.

44:19.440 --> 44:20.360
I'll wait here

44:20.640 --> 44:21.830
until you make it.

44:24.440 --> 44:25.900
Lord Lu's word is his bond.

44:25.920 --> 44:27.400
He never breaks his promise.

44:27.400 --> 44:28.200
Rest assured.

44:35.580 --> 44:36.110
I know

44:36.110 --> 44:37.840
that you've suffered greatly,

44:38.400 --> 44:40.860
carrying immense bitterness in your heart.

44:41.070 --> 44:41.870
Write it down.

44:42.840 --> 44:44.100
Only by writing it down

44:44.230 --> 44:46.490
can Lord Lu begin to seek justice for you.

47:40.840 --> 47:43.220
[The Evolution Theory of Tea Culture]

47:47.250 --> 47:49.690
Here's some fresh tea. Take your time.

47:49.720 --> 47:50.220
I'll take my leave now.

47:50.220 --> 47:51.550
No, you stay.

47:52.360 --> 47:54.360
I'd like you to be here while we talk.

47:55.800 --> 47:57.630
Chinese tea culture has a history
spanning thousands of years.

47:57.110 --> 47:59.750
[Tea has become
an essential part of daily life]

47:58.230 --> 47:59.880
According to legend, Shennong
discovered tea leaves

47:59.880 --> 48:01.400
while sampling hundreds of herbs.

48:01.400 --> 48:02.360
Gu Yanwu deduced

48:02.550 --> 48:05.110
that after the Qin Dynasty unified China,
the custom of tea drinking

48:05.110 --> 48:06.510
spread beyond the Bashu region

48:06.510 --> 48:07.740
and entered the Central Plains.

48:07.740 --> 48:09.060
By the Wei, Jin,
and Southern-Northern dynasties,

48:09.060 --> 48:10.690
it had evolved into a nationwide practice.

48:10.690 --> 48:12.050
In the Tang Dynasty,
Lu Yu's The Classic of Tea

48:12.050 --> 48:14.070
completed the framework
of classical tea studies.

48:14.070 --> 48:15.760
Tea became a life art

48:15.760 --> 48:17.090
for scholars and intellectuals.

48:17.090 --> 48:18.520
The concept of unity between Zen and tea

48:18.520 --> 48:19.920
began to gain popularity.

48:19.920 --> 48:22.170
In the Song Dynasty, the practices
of diancha and doucha prevailed.

48:22.170 --> 48:24.140
Tea drinking became integrated
with other aspects of daily life,

48:24.140 --> 48:25.770
its forms and content

48:25.790 --> 48:27.360
growing more complete and diverse.

48:27.360 --> 48:28.720
The emerging class of scholars

48:28.720 --> 48:30.850
played a vital role in this evolution.

48:31.360 --> 48:33.000
During the Ming and Qing dynasties,
loose tea rose to prominence.

48:33.000 --> 48:34.370
The tea brewing method was simplified.

48:34.370 --> 48:36.240
Through maritime trade, tea made its way

48:36.240 --> 48:37.570
to the rest of the world.

48:37.590 --> 48:38.440
Industrialization in modern times

48:38.440 --> 48:40.640
gave birth to new forms such as tea bags,

48:40.990 --> 48:44.320
while the traditional tea ceremony
experienced a revival.

48:45.550 --> 48:46.230
Today,

48:46.480 --> 48:48.560
tea culture has integrated
concepts of health

48:48.560 --> 48:49.990
and scientific innovation,

48:49.990 --> 48:52.180
achieving diverse and global development.

48:52.180 --> 48:53.300
It has transcended

48:53.430 --> 48:55.780
its role as a practical beverage
to become a cultural symbol

48:55.780 --> 48:57.190
bridging different times and places,

48:57.190 --> 48:58.430
embodying the thousand-year advancement

48:58.430 --> 49:00.720
of both material life
and spiritual pursuits.
